# Contract v1.3: the composition shows only in the panel's input line (pinyin with syllable spaces, a draft as
# "improve › ok"), never as marked text in the field; the field gets text only on commit.
# Owner decision 2026-11-15: punctuation typed right after an ASCII digit stays ASCII in Chinese mode (. , :), so
# numbers, times and amounts come out as written (rime-ice's punctuator/digit_separators, Config.typingSymbols).
NAME a colon right after a digit stays ASCII in Chinese mode
PROFILES all
LANG chinese
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE 12:30
EXPECT doc "Hi 12:30|"
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit none
EXPECT lang chinese
EXPECT nolost
